    "name_raw": "Planewalker's Insight",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Planar Adventures pg. 31",
    "definition_raw": "Source Planar Adventures pg. 31\nYou are well versed in the lore of the planes and the psychology of their natives.\n\nBenefit: You gain a +2 bonus on Knowledge (planes) checks and on Sense Motive checks against outsiders, and Knowledge (planes) is a class skill for you. If you have 10 or more ranks in either of these skills, the bonus for that skill increases to +4. These bonuses do not stack with those granted by the Alertness or Scholar feats.",
